{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Classic Pack: Rediscover the Classics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into automotive history with the Classic Pack DLC. This carefully crafted collection brings some of the most beloved classic cars to your dealership. Each one is a symbol of elegance, craftsmanship, and timeless design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each car has been selected to capture the spirit of the golden era of automobiles. Buy, restore, and sell these legendary vehicles to collector-type customers who value nostalgia, quality, and authenticity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DLC Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Timeless Classics:</strong> A lineup of iconic vintage models ready to restore and sell.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collector Buyers:</strong> Attract clients seeking rare and historical vehicles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Restoration &amp; Detailing:</strong> Increase value with repairs, maintenance, and presentation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Experience:</strong> Every car has been adapted for smooth in-game integration.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you are reliving the golden days of motoring or discovering these legends for the first time, the Classic Pack adds character, charm, and history to your garage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must own <strong>Car For Sale Simulator 2023</strong> to use this content.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3400460?t=1761656149","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400460/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761656149","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400460/38fce348cc70e794c65881fee0410d3de3689600/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761656149","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st